message: "If you use EpiLens in research, please cite the software and the accompanying paper when its final reference becomes available."
title: "EpiLens"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/VinsRR/EpiLens"
url: "https://github.com/VinsRR/EpiLens"
abstract: >-
  A local-first Python toolkit for evidence-grounded retrieval, classification,
  and structured information extraction over scientific literature, with a
  focus on epidemiology and public health.
